est.com/p/lqyevxd6x7d\n\nhttps://cdn.imgchest.com/files/3yrgc9kojo4.png", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nehituji21/works/152", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f7c57292/uploads/origins/19ad21bb-b489-45e0-828b-11d696522f24?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c9a10aa880a53a86ad87a685fc1a835e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f7c57292/uploads/origins/19ad21bb-b489-45e0-828b-11d696522f24?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c9a10aa880a53a86ad87a685fc1a835e, https://si.imgix.net/f7c57292/uploads/origins/19ad21bb-b489-45e0-828b-11d696522f24?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=354fc97508a703b04593c061fa832c1d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f7c57292/uploads/origins/19ad21bb-b489-45e0-828b-11d696522f24?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8c75e01011d94df89e0d333ff524f034 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "前回は素晴らしいイラストをありがとうございました！\n引き続き、私のOCの絵を描いて頂けますか？\n参考資料は添付URLを御覧ください。\n\n元気で快活な感じで描いていただけるとありがたいです！\n以上、よろしくお願いします!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1iI4SSbRG9bsqJPVMnWUdqpBH60r1qnn6?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nehituji21/works/151", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3ae0bfaa/uploads/origins/0fa654ce-81b4-4744-a100-a1b13de197ce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=91cc3ed4d7da95f317ad62ce446caa65", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3ae0bfaa/uploads/origins/0fa654ce-81b4-4744-a100-a1b13de197ce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=91cc3ed4d7da95f317ad62ce446caa65, https://si.imgix.net/3ae0bfaa/uploads/origins/0fa654ce-81b4-4744-a100-a1b13de197ce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3a78643236e3f94d4772924542c5e9dd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3ae0bfaa/uploads/origins/0fa654ce-81b4-4744-a100-a1b13de197ce?bg=%23fff&au